# stat obj's extra description keywords, the object's own and its prototype's. Smokegod (60) gives a scimitar
# (3005, whose prototype's extra description is "scimitar blade") one of its own, "engraving", and stats it. The
# two lists ran together with no space ("engravingscimitar blade", #97); now "engraving scimitar blade".
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@obj 3005 3001
string obj scimitar ed engraving A small engraving runs along the blade.
stat obj scimitar
